# keep only alphabetics, lowercased.
# NormalisedString ? String
Normalise ↚ ▽ ⊸∊ ⊂ +@0⇡10 +@a⇡26 ¯⌵

# Get the dimensions of the "square"
# Dimensions ? IntegerSize
GetDims ↚ ⊟ ⨬∘+₁ < ⤙⊙⊙⊙◌ ◡× ⊃⌊⌈ ⊸√

# Implement the classic method for composing secret messages called a square code
# Ciphertext ? Plaintext
Ciphertext ← |1 /$"_ _" ⍉ ⬚@\s↯ GetDims ⊸⧻ Normalise
